-    /**
-     * Returns `true` if the queue is empty.
-     *
-     * # Examples
-     *
-     * ```kotlin
-     * import crossbeamdeque.Injector
-     *
-     * val q = Injector.new()
-     * check(q.isEmpty())
-     * q.push(1)
-     * check(!q.isEmpty())
